So this is a remarkably talented family.

00:58:16.300 --> 00:58:18.353
He was not implicated in this.

00:58:21.050 --> 00:58:25.760
And as best as I know, was not involved.

00:58:25.760 --> 00:58:26.760
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:58:26.760 --> 00:58:31.320
- So we have a whole series
of questions, just aghast.

00:58:31.320 --> 00:58:33.630
Amy, why wasn't he jailed and convicted?

