00:58:36.480 --> 00:58:38.720
Couldn't some of the fly making community

00:58:38.720 --> 00:58:40.633
be identified and prosecuted?

00:58:42.090 --> 00:58:44.130
I know my myself, but before we met,

00:58:44.130 --> 00:58:45.670
I was calling Fish and Wildlife Service

00:58:45.670 --> 00:58:47.831
talking about my experiences
of seeing specimens

00:58:47.831 --> 00:58:50.930
that were being sold at shows,

00:58:50.930 --> 00:58:54.510
and well, there's more to crack down.

